    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This coursework evaluates how a learner explains, analyses and demonstrates managing open trades without moving risk boundaries emotionally using objective chart evidence, explicit invalidation and controlled risk.",
      "zh": "本课程作业评估学习者如何运用客观图表证据、明确失效条件与受控风险来解释、分析并展示管理持仓时避免情绪化移动风险边界。"
    },
